    "autonima": "included_fulltext",
    "reason": "Empirical VBM study compares smokers with nonsmokers and assesses GM volume (I1 met), but its reported significant GM difference used small-volume correction and the findings did not survive FDR/FWE correction; no qualifying whole-brain between-group GM result is demonstrated (I2 not met, E1 met). Original human structural MRI data rule out E2."
   },
   {
    "pmid": "23149031",
    "decision": "exclude",
