    "autonima": "included_fulltext",
    "reason": "The study reports global gray-matter volumes, but its whole-brain between-group contrasts assess cortical thickness rather than GM volume (I2 not_met). It is not limited to ROI analyses (E1 not_met)."
   },
   {
